    { "WARDH3", { "Use ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ and ~k~~GO_BACK~ to select an item.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ View~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Back", "Utilise ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ et ~k~~GO_BACK~ pour choisir un article.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Voir~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Revenir", "Benutze ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ und ~k~~GO_BACK~, um einen Artikel auszuwählen.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ansehen~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Zurück", "Usa ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ e ~k~~GO_BACK~ per scegliere un oggetto.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Vedi~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Esci", "Usa ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ y ~k~~GO_BACK~ para seleccionar una prenda.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ver~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás", "~k~~GO_FORWARD~ и ~k~~GO_BACK~ - выбрать.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ - просмотр.~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ - назад.", "Usa ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ y ~k~~GO_BACK~ para seleccionar una prenda.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ver~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás", "Usa ~k~~GO_FORWARD~ y ~k~~GO_BACK~ para seleccionar una prenda.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ver~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás" } },
    { "WARDH4", { "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Wear~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Back", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Porter~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Revenir", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Tragen~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Zurück", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Indossa~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Esci", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ponerse~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ - надеть.~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ - назад.", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ponerse~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás", "~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Ponerse~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Atrás" } },
    { "WINCH_V", { "Use ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ and ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ to move the winch close to a vehicle. ~N~Press ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ to release.", "Utilise ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ et ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ pour placer le treuil près d'un véhicule.~N~Appuyer sur ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ pour relâcher.", "Benutze ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ und ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~, um die Winde nahe an ein Fahrzeug heran zu bewegen.~N~Drücke ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~, um loszulassen.", "Usa ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ e ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ per muovere il gancio vicino a un veicolo.~N~Premi ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ per rilasciare.", "Usa ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ y ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ para acercar el cabestrante a un vehículo.~N~Pulsa ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ para soltar.", "~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ - поднять магнит.~n~~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ - опустить магнит.~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ - отцепить объект от магнита.", "Usa ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ y ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ para acercar el cabestrante a un vehículo.~N~Pulsa ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ para soltar.", "Usa ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETUP~ y ~k~~VEHICLE_TURRETDOWN~ para acercar el cabestrante a un vehículo.~N~Pulsa ~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ para soltar." } },
    { "WINDOWS", { "To smash the windows, hit them with a weapon or throw a molotov at them.", "Pour péter les fenêtres, tire dessus avec une arme ou jette un cocktail Molotov.", "Um die Fenster einzuwerfen, schieße mit einer Waffe darauf oder schleudere einen Molotowcocktail dagegen.", "Per rompere i vetri, colpiscili con un'arma oppure lancia una molotov.", "Para romper las ventanas, dales con un arma o arrójales un cóctel molotov.", "Чтобы разбить окна, выстрели в них из оружия, либо брось в них коктейль Молотова.", "Para romper las ventanas, dales con un arma o arrójales un cóctel molotov.", "Para romper las ventanas, dales con un arma o arrójales un cóctel molotov." } },
    { "WOFHD01", { "Use the movement controls to select wager.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Increase Wager~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Decrease Wager~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Proceed~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Quit", "Utilise les contrôles de déplacement pour choisir une mise.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Augmenter la mise~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Réduire la mise~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ continuer~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Quitter", "Benutze die Bewegungskontrolle, um den Einsatz zu wählen.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Einsatz erhöhen~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Einsatz verringern~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Weiter~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Beenden", "Usa i comandi di movimento per selezionare la puntata.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Aumenta la posta~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Riduci la posta~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Procedi~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Esci", "Usa los controles de movimiento para seleccionar una apuesta.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Subir apuesta~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Bajar apuesta~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Continuar~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Salir", "Клавиши передвижения - выбрать ставку.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ - повысить ставку.~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ - понизить ставку.~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ - продолжить.~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ - выход.", "Usa los controles de movimiento para seleccionar una apuesta.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Subir apuesta~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Bajar apuesta~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Continuar~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Salir", "Usa los controles de movimiento para seleccionar una apuesta.~n~~k~~PED_JUMPING~ Subir apuesta~N~~k~~PED_FIREWEAPON~ Bajar apuesta~N~~k~~PED_SPRINT~ Continuar~N~~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ Salir" } },
